{"sha": "3ea082adbb6707c5b9b999cf55f90922979240c9488d7503759bb2fadba6a322", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g9:solids} 章 --- 立体图形与体积}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:solids:1}", "长方体：$V = 4 \\times 5 \\times 12 = 240$。", "", "圆柱：$V = \\pi r^2 h = \\pi \\times 9 \\times 7 = 63\\pi \\approx 198$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:solids:2}", "圆锥：$V = \\frac13 \\pi r^2 h = \\frac13 \\pi \\times 25 \\times 12 =", "100\\pi \\approx 314$。", "", "棱锥：底面积 $B = 8 \\times 3 = 24$，所以", "$V = \\frac13 \\times 24 \\times 10 = 80$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:solids:3}", "体积：$V = \\frac43 \\pi \\times 6^3 = \\frac43 \\pi \\times 216 = 288\\pi$。", "", "表面积：$4\\pi \\times 6^2 = 144\\pi$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:solids:4}", "截面半径：$\\sqrt{r^2 - d^2} = \\sqrt{100 - 64} = \\sqrt{36}", "= 6$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:solids:5}", "从整个圆锥到小圆锥的相似比：", "$k = \\frac{9}{12} = \\frac34$。截面半径：$8 \\times \\frac34 = 6$。", "", "整个圆锥的体积：$\\frac13\\pi \\times 64 \\times 12 = 256\\pi$。", "小圆锥的体积：$256\\pi \\times \\left(\\frac34\\right)^3 =", "256\\pi \\times \\frac{27}{64} = 108\\pi \\approx 339$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:solids:6}", "球的体积：$\\frac43\\pi \\times 2^3 = \\frac{32\\pi}{3}$ cm$^3$。", "这部分体积铺在底面积 $\\pi \\times 3^2 = 9\\pi$ cm$^2$ 上，", "因此水位上升", "\\[", "\\frac{32\\pi/3}{9\\pi} = \\frac{32}{27} \\approx 1.2 \\text{ cm}", "\\]", "（约 $12$ mm）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:solids:7}", "小模具是大模具按比例 $k = \\frac36 =", "\\frac12$，因此其体积是大模具的 $\\left(\\frac12\\right)^3 = \\frac18$，", "配方可以装满 $8$ 个小模具。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:solids:8}", "$V = \\frac13 \\times 230^2 \\times 147 = \\frac13 \\times 52\\,900 \\times 147", "= 52\\,900 \\times 49 = 2\\,592\\,100$ m$^3$ ——约为 $2.6$ 百万", "立方米。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:solids:9}", "\\emph{1.} 水形成一个按 $k = \\frac12$ 缩放的圆锥（尖端朝下，", "高为一半），因此其体积为漏斗的 $\\left(\\frac12\\right)^3 = \\frac18$", "：只有八分之一，远少于一半！", "", "\\emph{2.} 水深为 $d$ 时形成一个按", "$k = \\frac{d}{12}$ 缩放的圆锥，其体积为漏斗的 $k^3$ 倍。体积为一半意味着", "$k^3 = \\frac12$，即", "$\\left(\\frac{d}{12}\\right)^3 = \\frac12$。于是", "$\\frac{d}{12} = \\sqrt[3]{0.5} \\approx 0.7937$，因此", "$d \\approx 9.5$ cm：后一半体积只占据顶部", "$2.5$ cm——锥体较宽的部分容纳了大部分的水。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g9:solids:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $V_{\\text{圆柱}} = \\pi r^2 \\times 2r = 2\\pi r^3$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $\\dfrac{V_{\\text{球}}}{V_{\\text{圆柱}}}", "= \\dfrac{\\frac43 \\pi r^3}{2 \\pi r^3} = \\dfrac23$。$\\pi$ 与", "$r^3$ 约去：这一比例是\\emph{普遍的}——", "对弹珠和行星都成立。这是形状之间的关系，而非", "数字之间的关系：正是值得刻在", "石头上的那类真理。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 球：$4\\pi r^2$。圆柱：侧面积", "$2\\pi r \\times 2r = 4\\pi r^2$，加上两个底面", "$2 \\times \\pi r^2$，总计 $6\\pi r^2$。比值：", "$\\frac{4\\pi r^2}{6\\pi r^2} = \\frac23$——同样的三分之二，", "这次针对表面积。（还有一个附带结论：球的表面积恰好等于", "圆柱的侧面积。）", "", "\\textbf{4.} 剩余体积：$2\\pi r^3 - \\frac43\\pi r^3 =", "\\frac23 \\pi r^3$。两个半径为 $r$、高为 $r$ 的圆锥：", "$2 \\times \\frac13 \\pi r^2 \\times r = \\frac23 \\pi r^3$。两者相等。", "", "\\textbf{5.} 球：$\\frac43 \\pi \\times 12^3 \\approx 7\\,200$", "cm$^3$；盒子：$2\\pi \\times 12^3 \\approx 10\\,900$ cm$^3$。空的部分：", "占盒子的三分之一，约为 $33\\,\\%$——", "由第 2 题保证，与球的大小无关。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 半球：", "$\\frac12 \\times \\frac43 \\pi \\times 10^3 = \\frac23 \\pi \\times", "1\\,000 \\approx 2\\,094$ cm$^3 \\approx 2.1$ L。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 圆锥：$\\frac13 \\pi \\times 10^2 \\times 10 =", "\\frac{1\\,000\\pi}{3} \\approx 1\\,047$ cm$^3$。半球：", "$\\frac{2\\,000\\pi}{3} \\approx 2\\,094$ cm$^3$。圆柱：", "$1\\,000\\pi \\approx 3\\,142$ cm$^3$。比值：", "$\\frac{1000\\pi}{3} : \\frac{2000\\pi}{3} : \\frac{3000\\pi}{3}", "= 1 : 2 : 3$，恰好成立。", "", "\\textbf{8.} $\\frac43 \\pi \\times 27 = \\pi \\times 9 \\times h$", "得 $h = \\frac43 \\times 3 = 4$ cm，恰好成立。", ""]}